<title>UK: Wagon sees H1 profit lower, H2 improvement.</title>
<headline>Wagon sees H1 profit lower, H2 improvement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wagon Industrial Plc said on Wednesday it expects first half profits to be lower than in the previous year but order book and business prospects for the second half should result in an improved operating performance.</p>
</text>
